<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 5.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 5.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Thursday, June 5:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,636.10 (1,603.60)	CHF  1,132.40 (1,118.80)</p>
<p>    DEM    945.45 (929.30)	  GBP  2,662.10 (2,622.50)</p>
<p>    ATS    134.36 (132.02)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $12.23 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$11.74 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $23.97 million ($18.09 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
